## song_composition_advanced_demo.bax
## Spec 008 advanced binding — section blocks + form + per-channel role
##
## Same song as song_composition_demo.bax after Beginner Mode desugars.
## Prefer this form when you need to:
##   - Remap roles (e.g. bass on pulse2 / harm on wave — see dancefloor_pulse.bax)
##   - Mix role-bound channels with classic `seq` / `pat` channels
##   - Target chips that are not exactly four channels
##
## `form` still declares section order once; each channel picks a role from that form.

song name "Song Composition (Advanced)"
song artist "The BeatBax Team"
song description """Advanced section / form / channel role binding demo (spec 008)."""
song tags "demo,composition,advanced,section,form,role"

chip gameboy
bpm 140
stepsPerBar 4

inst lead type=pulse1 duty=2 env=12,down,3
inst arp type=pulse2 duty=1 env=10,down,2
inst bass type=wave volume=100 wave=0123456789ABCDEFFEDCBA9876543210
inst kick type=noise env=15,down,1

pat mel_a = C4 E4 G4 E4
pat mel_b = D4 F4 A4 F4
pat harm_a = E4 G4 C5 G4
pat harm_b = F4 A4 D5 A4
pat bass_a = C3 C3 G2 G2
pat bass_b = D3 D3 A2 A2
pat drum_a = C4 . C4 .
pat drum_b = C4 C4 . C4

section intro {
  mel = mel_a
  harm = harm_a
  bass = bass_a
  perc = drum_a
}

section hook {
  mel = mel_b
  harm = harm_b
  bass = bass_b
  perc = drum_b
}

form main = intro, hook

channel 1 => inst lead role mel form main
channel 2 => inst arp role harm form main
channel 3 => inst bass role bass form main
channel 4 => inst kick role perc form main

play
